# Safety net: the reference solutions must never be committed to this repo. They
# live outside it, in the interviewer's kit, and each one has the same class name
# as the file it replaces -- so if one is ever dropped in under a different name,
# or the whole folder is copied in, keep it out of git.
solution-dropin/
solution/
**/*Fixed.java
**/*-PriceBoard.java
**/*-AccountService.java
**/*-PriceAggregator.java
